{
  "_source": "Harvested the same way as NODE-SHAPES.json, from published workflows on api.n8n.io/api/templates/workflows/<id>. These are the node types templates 3-20 need that NODE-SHAPES.json does not carry. Same rule applies: use these type strings and typeVersions verbatim.",
